layout: layouts/component-demo.njk
title: Popup
description: a temporary overlay that appears above page content
---

{% from "components/popup/macro.njk" import popup %}

{% from "components/button/macro.njk" import button %}

<p>The popup is <code>popover="auto"</code>: the button opens it with
  <code>command="toggle-popover"</code> and <code>commandfor</code> (or
  <code>popovertarget</code>), with no script. Escape or a click outside closes it.</p>

<p>
  {{ button({
    text: "Show popup",
    attributes: { "aria-haspopup": "dialog", "aria-controls": "popup-hello", command: "toggle-popover", commandfor: "popup-hello", popovertarget: "popup-hello" }
  }) }}
</p>

{% call popup({ id: "popup-hello", label: "Hello" }) %}
  <h3>Hello</h3>
  <p>This is a popup.</p>
  <button type="button" command="hide-popover" commandfor="popup-hello" popovertarget="popup-hello" popovertargetaction="hide" class="button button-secondary">Close</button>
{% endcall %}

